<tr>
	<td>
		<table style="width: 100%; border-spacing: 1px; margin: 0 auto;" >
		 <tr style="display: none;"><th>col1</th><th>col2</th><th>col3</th><th>col4</th></tr>
		 <tr><td colspan="4" style="padding: 2px;">&nbsp;</td></tr>
        <tr style="text-align: center;"><td colspan="4" class="headingEng" style="padding: 2px;"><u>Forklift Truck Conditions of Licence</u></td></tr>
		<tr><td colspan="4" style="padding: 2px;">&nbsp;</td></tr>
		<tr>
		<td style="width: 10px; padding: 2px;">&nbsp;</td>
		<td colspan="3" style="padding: 2px;">
		<div style="text-align: justify;">
		&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;The registration and licensing of the forklift truck is subject to the following conditions which may be reviewed periodically:
		</div>
		</td></tr>
		<tr><td colspan="4" style="padding: 2px;">&nbsp;</td></tr>
        <tr style="text-align: left;"> 
		  <td style="width: 10px; padding: 2px;">&nbsp;</td>
		  <td style="width: 28px; vertical-align: top; padding: 2px;">(1)</td>
          <td colspan="2" style="padding: 2px;">
		  <div style="text-align: justify;">
		  Driver driving a forklift truck shall possess a valid full driving licence with driving entitlement "Special Purpose Vehicle" (vehicle class 21), and the Transport Department has approved the driver to drive that forklift truck;
		  </div>
		  </td>
        </tr>
		<tr><td colspan="4" style="padding: 2px;">&nbsp;</td></tr>
		<tr style="text-align: left;"> 
		<td style="width: 10px; padding: 2px;">&nbsp;</td>
		  <td style="width: 25px; vertical-align: top; padding: 2px;">(2)</td>
          <td colspan="2" style="padding: 2px;">
		  <div style="text-align: justify;">
		Operation of the forklift truck is restricted to the route as previously approved by the Transport Department;
		  </div>
		  </td>
        </tr>
		<tr><td colspan="4" style="padding: 2px;">&nbsp;</td></tr>
		<tr style="text-align: left;"> 
		 <td style="width: 10px; padding: 2px;">&nbsp;</td>
		  <td style="width: 25px; vertical-align: top; padding: 2px;">(3)</td>
          <td colspan="2" style="padding: 2px;">
		  <div style="text-align: justify;">
		  	The forklift truck is only allowed to be used for carriage of goods;
		  </div>
		  </td>
        </tr>
		<tr><td colspan="4" style="padding: 2px;">&nbsp;</td></tr>
		<tr style="text-align: left;"> 
			<td style="width: 10px; padding: 2px;">&nbsp;</td>
		  <td style="width: 25px; vertical-align: top; padding: 2px;">(4)</td>
          <td colspan="2" style="padding: 2px;">
		  <div style="text-align: justify;">
		 Whilst in motion on the road, the fork must be in the lowered position, the driver must ensure that he has a clear field of vision, loads must not obstruct his field of vision;
		  </div>
		  </td>
        </tr>
		<tr><td colspan="4" style="padding: 2px;">&nbsp;</td></tr>
		<tr style="text-align: left;"> 
			<td style="width: 10px; padding: 2px;">&nbsp;</td>
		  <td style="width: 25px; vertical-align: top; padding: 2px;">(5)</td>
          <td colspan="2" style="padding: 2px;">
		  <div style="text-align: justify;">
		 	Special attention must be paid at all times to the traffic nearby and the safety of pedestrians;
		  </div>
		  </td>
        </tr>
		<tr><td colspan="4" style="padding: 2px;">&nbsp;</td></tr>
		<tr style="text-align: left;"> 
			<td style="width: 10px; padding: 2px;">&nbsp;</td>
		  <td style="width: 25px; vertical-align: top; padding: 2px;">(6)</td>
          <td colspan="2" style="padding: 2px;">
		  <div style="text-align: justify;">
		 	No undue obstruction should be caused to pedestrians and other vehicles;
		  </div>
		  </td>
        </tr>
		<tr><td colspan="4" style="padding: 2px;">&nbsp;</td></tr>
		<tr style="text-align: left;"> 
			<td style="width: 10px; padding: 2px;">&nbsp;</td>
		  <td style="width: 25px; vertical-align: top; padding: 2px;">(7)</td>
          <td colspan="2" style="padding: 2px;">
		  <div style="text-align: justify;">
		 The vehicle licence should be displayed on the forklift truck and driver of the forklift truck must bring along the original of this document when driving, and produce it to police officer for inspection as and when required;
		  </div>
		  </td>
        </tr>
		<tr><td colspan="4" style="padding: 2px;">&nbsp;</td></tr>
		<tr style="text-align: left;"> 
			<td style="width: 10px; padding: 2px;">&nbsp;</td>
		  <td style="width: 25px; vertical-align: top; padding: 2px;">(8)</td>
          <td colspan="2" style="padding: 2px;">
		  <div style="text-align: justify;">
		 The vehicle registration mark should be displayed on the back of the vehicle;
		  </div>
		  </td>
        </tr>
		<tr><td colspan="4" style="padding: 2px;">&nbsp;</td></tr>
		<tr style="text-align: left;"> 
			<td style="width: 10px; padding: 2px;">&nbsp;</td>
		  <td style="width: 25px; vertical-align: top; padding: 2px;">(9)</td>
          <td colspan="2" style="padding: 2px;">
		  <div style="text-align: justify;">
		 	Vehicle owner needs to acquire sufficient and appropriate amount of third party risks insurance for the equipment installed on the forklift truck and operation of such equipment;
		  </div>
		  </td>
        </tr>
		
		<tr><td colspan="4" style="padding: 2px;">&nbsp;</td></tr>
		<tr style="text-align: left;"> 
			<td style="width: 10px; padding: 2px;">&nbsp;</td>
		  <td style="width: 25px; vertical-align: top; padding: 2px;">(10)</td>
          <td colspan="2" style="padding: 2px;">
		  <div style="text-align: justify;">
		 		Carriage of passengers is not allowed;
		  </div>
		  </td>
        </tr>
	  
	   <tr><td colspan="4" style="padding: 2px;">&nbsp;</td></tr>
		<tr style="text-align: left;"> 
			<td style="width: 5px; padding: 2px;">&nbsp;</td>
		  <td style="width: 25px; vertical-align: top; padding: 2px;">(11)</td>
          <td colspan="2" style="padding: 2px;">
		  <div style="text-align: justify;">
		 		The maximum vehicle speed shall not exceed 15km/hr;
		  </div>
		  </td>
        </tr>
		 <tr><td colspan="4" style="padding: 2px;">&nbsp;</td></tr>
		 <tr><td colspan="4" style="padding: 2px;">&nbsp;</td></tr>
		 <tr><td colspan="4" style="padding: 2px;">&nbsp;</td></tr>
	
			
		<tr style="text-align: center;"> 
          <td colspan="4" class="footerChi" style="padding: 2px;">牌照事務組</td>
        </tr>

        <tr style="text-align: center;"> 
          <td colspan="4" class="footerEng" style="padding: 2px;">Licensing Section</td>
        </tr>
        <tr style="text-align: center;"> 
          <td colspan="4" class="footerChi" style="padding: 2px;">香港金鐘道九十五號統一中心三樓</td>
        </tr>
        <tr style="text-align: center;"> 
          <td colspan="4" class="footerEng" style="padding: 2px;">3rd Floor   United Centre   95 Queensway   Hong Kong</td>
        </tr>
		<tr style="text-align: center;"> 
          <td colspan="4" class="footerEng" style="padding: 2px;">網址 Web Site: http://www.td.gov.hk</td>
        </tr>
